==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*4 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Madam Peng]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Emperor Warumongar]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage. If you've upgraded [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Cat]] to Lv.10, you can just spam him for an easy win.

